ategory badge (e.g. Resume), scenario badge (e.g. Business), description, author, usage count (e.g. 1,250 uses), and updated date (e.g. Updated 2024-12-01).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Preview rendered Markdown correctly: H1 name heading, bold job title, separator line, H2 section headings (Professional Summary, Experience, Education, Skills), H3 sub-heading, italic date range, and all placeholders replaced with entered values with no leftover {{placeholder}} tokens.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filter 'Resume' narrowed to 1/6 (Professional Resume); Scenario filter 'Academic' narrowed to 1/6 (Academic Research Summary); Sort 'Alphabetical' reordered all 6 items into correct A-Z order (Academic Research Summary, Meeting Minutes, Professional Email, Professional Resume, Project Proposal, Weekly Status Report).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Search does not tolerate typos\", \"actual\": \"Searching 'Resme' and 'Reusme' (small typos of 'Resume') both returned 'Showing 0 of 6 templates' / 'No templates found' with no suggestions and no matching templates, instead of returning or suggesting 'Professional Resume'.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking the favorite toggle on Professional Resume set it to 'on', header favorites count became 1, and toggling the Favorites filter switched grid to a favorites-only view showing 'Showing 1 of 6 templates' with only Professional Resume.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Within favorites-only view, searching 'Resume' still matched the 1 favorited template, and filtering by category 'Email' correctly narrowed to 0 results with 'No favorites yet' empty state, showing search/filter works within favorites scope.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Copy to Clipboard triggered a toast notification 'Copied to clipboard! The generated content has been copied.'\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-28\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After navigating/reloading http://localhost:6089/, the grid still shows 'Showing 7 of 7 templates' including custom 'QA Custom Template', and its favorite toggle remains 'on' with header favorites count still '1'.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No format validation for declared-format fields (email)\", \"actual\": \"Entering an invalid email value 'not-an-email' into the required Email field did not block the preview or show any validation error; the Preview Result tab remained enabled and rendered 'not-an-email' directly into the output text.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Submit Template with all fields blank kept the dialog open with no new template created (grid remained 'Showing 6 of 6 templates'), confirming submission was blocked without required fields.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing '# Jane *Doe* [Link](javascript:alert(1)) <script>alert(1)</script>' into Full Name showed inline error 'Special characters like < > { } [ ] \\\\\\\\ | ` are not allowed' and the Preview Result tab became disabled again.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Preview Result tab was disabled (click timed out, element not enabled) when fields were empty, and became clickable/active only after all required fields were filled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-27\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Template submission does not validate placeholder/field mapping\", \"actual\":