ue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Favoriting Professional Resume set toggle 'on', header showed 'Favorites 1'; unfavoriting immediately reverted toggle to default, header reverted to 'Favorites' (no count) and favorites-only view updated to 'Showing 0 of 6 templates' / 'No favorites yet' without reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-25\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Markdown template (Professional Resume) rendered with proper headings, bold/italic emphasis, and separator after field substitution.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-26\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Immediately after clicking Submit Template (no reload), the grid result count updated from 'Showing 6 of 6 templates' to 'Showing 7 of 7 templates' and the new template card was visible.\"}]}"
